WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.063 --> 00:00:03.384
"Don't worry," Terrell said.

2
00:00:03.385 --> 00:00:09.268
"The Tang Monk has two other companions—Zhu Bajie and Sha Wujing."

3
00:00:09.269 --> 00:00:13.512
The first man shook his head. "The demons captured them too."

4
00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:17.680
The second man looked down. "It's very sad."

5
00:00:17.681 --> 00:00:21.264
The third man started to cry.

6
00:00:21.265 --> 00:00:22.838
Terrell bit his lip.

7
00:00:22.839 --> 00:00:25.651
Nobody was around to save Wukong's friends.

8
00:00:25.652 --> 00:00:28.139
"Except me," he thought.

9
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:32.571
He looked at the men. "Do you know where the demons took them?"

10
00:00:32.572 --> 00:00:33.802
The men nodded.

11
00:00:33.803 --> 00:00:36.809
"Take me there," Terrell said.

12
00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:39.321
They soon arrived at a cave.

13
00:00:39.322 --> 00:00:44.199
One man pointed. "The Tang Monk and his companions are in there."

14
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.917
Terrell took a deep breath and stepped inside the cave.

15
00:00:48.918 --> 00:00:52.731
The air was cold and damp. "Hello?"

16
00:00:52.732 --> 00:00:56.206
Boom! Terrell spun around.

17
00:00:56.207 --> 00:00:59.082
A huge boulder blocked the entrance!

18
00:00:59.083 --> 00:01:01.079
Outside, light sparkled.

19
00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:04.783
The three men disappeared. Demons stood in their places.

20
00:01:04.784 --> 00:01:06.749
The plant demon scratched his head.

21
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.789
"Was he a person or a demon?"

22
00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:14.579
The little demon shrugged. "I think he was a person inside a demon."

23
00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:17.887
"Who cares?" the crocodile demon said.

24
00:01:17.888 --> 00:01:22.950
"Let's find the Tang Monk so we can start living forever!"

25
00:01:22.951 --> 00:01:27.868
*** "Grr!" Terrell pushed the boulder, but it didn't

26
00:01:27.869 --> 00:01:32.543
budge. "Silly, you!" Bippo projected a

27
00:01:32.544 --> 00:01:36.076
portal. They stepped through and were back outside the

28
00:01:36.077 --> 00:01:40.740
cave. Terrell grinned. "I forgot you could do that. Thanks,

29
00:01:40.741 --> 00:01:42.743
Bippo!" "Helper,

30
00:01:42.744 --> 00:01:44.807
me!" Terrell's smile quickly

31
00:01:44.808 --> 00:01:48.967
faded. "Those people trapped us. What if they were the

32
00:01:48.968 --> 00:01:52.275
demons? We have to stop them!" He looked

33
00:01:52.276 --> 00:01:55.145
around. "But where did they

34
00:01:55.146 --> 00:02:00.954
go?" Bippo flew above the trees. "See them,

35
00:02:00.955 --> 00:02:06.043
me!" Terrell and Bippo hurried and soon found three demons attacking Wukong's

36
00:02:06.044 --> 00:02:11.698
friends! Bajie swung his rake at a crocodile demon. "I thought Wukong chased you away!"

37
00:02:11.699 --> 00:02:14.310
The demon smiled. "Nope!"

38
00:02:14.311 --> 00:02:17.683
Wujing struck a plant demon with his spear. Poof!

39
00:02:17.684 --> 00:02:19.698
A leaf fell to the ground.

40
00:02:19.699 --> 00:02:23.325
"Let go!" The Tang Monk shook a little demon off his leg.

41
00:02:23.326 --> 00:02:25.745
The demon hit a rock.

42
00:02:25.746 --> 00:02:28.645
"I'm sorry!" The Tang Monk hurried over.

43
00:02:28.646 --> 00:02:30.158
"I didn't mean to hurt—"

44
00:02:30.159 --> 00:02:33.241
"Grr!" The little demon jumped.

45
00:02:33.242 --> 00:02:36.108
"Ahh!" The Tang Monk ran.

46
00:02:36.109 --> 00:02:39.416
Bippo fired his laser. Poof!

47
00:02:39.417 --> 00:02:42.755
The demon turned into a snail.

48
00:02:42.756 --> 00:02:45.316
The crocodile demon dodged Wujing's spear.

49
00:02:45.317 --> 00:02:49.049
Bajie's rake came down fast. The demon ducked.

50
00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:52.694
Terrell jumped and landed on it. Poof!

51
00:02:52.695 --> 00:02:56.207
He picked up his foot and saw a newt.

52
00:02:56.208 --> 00:02:59.155
Bajie and Wujing aimed their weapons at Terrell.

53
00:02:59.156 --> 00:03:02.183
"Who are you?" Wujing asked.

54
00:03:02.184 --> 00:03:04.936
Terrell quickly opened the robot's head.

55
00:03:04.937 --> 00:03:10.318
The Tang Monk smiled. "Terrell! What are you doing here?"

56
00:03:10.319 --> 00:03:12.682
Terrell told them everything he knew.

57
00:03:12.683 --> 00:03:18.575
Bajie laughed. "Wukong is stuck in a cage?"

58
00:03:18.576 --> 00:03:22.358
The Tang Monk frowned. "It's not funny, Bajie."

59
00:03:22.359 --> 00:03:27.187
Wujing shook his head. "Bajie, you should be ashamed."

60
00:03:27.188 --> 00:03:31.168
Bajie shrugged. "He laughed at me when I was in jail."

61
00:03:31.169 --> 00:03:35.676
"Rocket Girl and Kid Comet are with Wukong," Terrell said.

62
00:03:35.677 --> 00:03:39.757
"I'm sure they'll escape. But I need to stop the earthquakes.

63
00:03:39.758 --> 00:03:43.389
Wukong said I should find the bodhisattva Guanyin."

64
00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:47.331
"Yes, perhaps she can help you," the Tang Monk said.

65
00:03:47.332 --> 00:03:50.838
"Bajie will take you to her."

66
00:03:50.839 --> 00:03:56.396
Soon Terrell, Bippo, and Bajie were soaring over the sea.

67
00:03:56.397 --> 00:03:58.690
Bright light filled the sky.

68
00:03:58.691 --> 00:04:02.799
A large bird appeared, carrying an old vase in one of its claws.

69
00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:12.914
"I know why you're here," the bird said. "Follow me!"

